@startuml Refactoring Roadmap
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title **Recommended Refactoring Roadmap**

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor<<critical>> #FFCDD2
    BorderColor<<critical>> #E53935
    BackgroundColor<<high>> #FFE0B2
    BorderColor<<high>> #FB8C00
    BackgroundColor<<medium>> #FFF9C4
    BorderColor<<medium>> #FBC02D
    BackgroundColor<<new>> #C8E6C9
    BorderColor<<new>> #43A047
}

package "Priority 1: CRITICAL" <<critical>> {
    rectangle "Remove Test Class\nfrom Production" as p1_1
    rectangle "Fix False-Positive\nTests" as p1_2
}

note right of p1_1
    OrderCreationHandler.php:13
    Create OrderInterface
end note

note right of p1_2
    3 tests with assertTrue(true)
    Replace or delete
end note

package "Priority 2: HIGH" <<high>> {
    rectangle "Create\nOrderPaymentStateService" as p2_1 <<new>>
    rectangle "Create\nContractFulfillmentService" as p2_2 <<new>>
    rectangle "Fix Stripe SDK\nin Handlers" as p2_3
    rectangle "Remove\n$_REQUEST Modification" as p2_4
}

note right of p2_1
    Consolidate 4 OXPAID locations
    Single date handling strategy
end note

note right of p2_2
    Consolidate 3 fulfillment locations
    Single event dispatch
end note

note right of p2_3
    Route through StripeAdapter
    Add: retrieveCheckoutSession()
    Add: createRefund()
end note

note right of p2_4
    StripeCheckoutReturnHandler:302
    Use middleware/service
end note

package "Priority 3: MEDIUM" <<medium>> {
    rectangle "Extract\nRefundService" as p3_1 <<new>>
    rectangle "Fix ContainerFactory\nUsage" as p3_2
    rectangle "Refactor Large\nTest Files" as p3_3
}

note right of p3_1
    From StripeRefundRequestHandler
    250 lines -> 25 lines
end note

note right of p3_2
    4 files with lazy loading
    Fix DI circular dependencies
end note

note right of p3_3
    Use @dataProvider
    Remove Registry::set()
end note

p1_1 --> p2_1
p1_2 --> p2_1
p2_1 --> p2_2
p2_2 --> p2_3
p2_3 --> p2_4
p2_4 --> p3_1
p3_1 --> p3_2
p3_2 --> p3_3

note as N1
    **New Services to Create:**
    1. OrderPaymentStateService - OXPAID updates
    2. ContractFulfillmentService - fulfillment logic
    3. RefundService - refund orchestration
    4. DeliveryAddressSessionService - session state
end note

N1 .. p3_3

@enduml
